# <configuration> <test> <seed>
# Every test runs on every configuration, except: the extractor tests need PARA_N_EXTRACT of at
# least 1, test_no_extractor needs PARA_N_EXTRACT = 0. Random traffic: test_random_long
# (500000 cycles) seeds 1-10 on the default configuration, test_random_traffic (100000 cycles)
# seeds 1-3 elsewhere.
# test_checker_fault is not listed: it must end in FAIL and is run once by hand to confirm that
# the checker reports errors.
